   Educ; ACM Europe Council; Informat Europe; Github Educ; Univ Milano,
   Dipartimento Informatica},
Abstract = {The aim of this work is to describe a simple and cost effective way to
   integrate generative AI into GitHub to support course specific
   scenarios. We are motivated by helping teachers realise their creative
   AI use cases in spite of technical barriers and also to ensure that
   students have a blessed and fair way to access AI services without
   needing to sign-up, prompt or pay. First we will describe a scenario
   that we have implemented for our own CS1 course, then we will describe
   the technical requirements for implementation. We finish off with our
   early thoughts on where these types of scenarios might be heading in
   terms of supporting computing education.},
