   Dipartimento Informatica},
Abstract = {Educators are fundamental in the development and implementation of
   adaptive learning. Their involvement is a core role in the education
   sector. This PhD aims to understand educators' role as stakeholders in
   creating adaptive learning environments.
   Work to date has included a systematic literature review and
   interview/workshop sessions with twelve educators to understand their
   teaching styles and how they adapt their lessons. Literature and
   interview findings will be used to develop an adaptive learning system,
   using educators' current methods as ``education design patterns{''} that
   can assist in making more interactive and adaptive educational lessons.},
